meta {
	name: 03_RightKeyValidation
	seq: 3
}

docs {
	Scenario: Right keys that are not in the resource policy are rejected

		Given the approver has no pending request from the requester for the resource
		When the requester asks for a right key that is not in the policy, the request fails
		When the requester asks for the whole resource through v2
		And the approver selects a right key that is not in the policy, the approval fails
		Then the request is still pending, with nothing approved
		Finally the approver rejects the request to clean up
}
